.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-auto.yaml:1598:            - "PRE-DISPATCH RULE (read before running the script): when this run is ITSELF a fan-out CLI lineage — config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir is bound, or SPECKIT_FANOUT_LINEAGE_ID / SPECKIT_CLI_DISPATCH_STACK / CODEX_SESSION_ID is present in the environment — the lineage IS the executor. Do NOT run this dispatch script. Perform the iteration in-process instead: read the rendered prompt at {state_paths.prompt_dir}/iteration-{current_iteration}.md, do the review pass yourself, and write the iteration file, the delta and the state record exactly as the leaf contract requires, then continue to post_dispatch_validate."
