.skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-review-presentation.txt:82:| `config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir` | N | internal flag `--fanout-lineage-artifact-dir=PATH` or marker `config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir` | none | N |
